      "h5": null,
      "text": "20 May 2015"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "h2": null,
      "h3": null,
      "h4": null,
      "h5": null,
      "text": "In 2014 overseas residents made 34.4 million visits to the UK, 23.9% higher than in 2004. During this time, visits from residents of North America have decreased 16.8% to 3.6 million in 2014, whereas visits from Europe and other countries have increased 31.0% and 33.6% respectively."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "h2": null,
      "h3": null,
      "h4": null,
      "h5": null,
      "text": "The data below show the change in the number of visits to the UK by overseas residents over the last ten years."
